# Render from the repo root: vhs assets/tapes/shopping-list.tape
Output assets/shopping-list.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 760
Set Height 300
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='> ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "bun examples/shopping-list.ts"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "q"
Sleep 800ms
